{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27268","headline":"题朱秀城南亭子 · 章孝标","name":"题朱秀城南亭子","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朱家亭子象悬匏，阶莹青莎栋剪茆。\n瘿挂眼开欺鸲鹆，花缘网结妬螵蛸。\n有时风月输三虎，无壁琴书属四郊。\n土木欲知精洁处，社天归燕怯安巢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"章孝标","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27268.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27268","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}